# Splice router: the #2-team schedule as the base, yhay81's tapes when YARN_STORE draws.
#
# PROVENANCE. Two sources, both public.
#
# 1. The base schedule ("fam") is the 719-action history of seat 1 of public
#    ladder episode 103384363 (2026-08-30 15:30 UTC), played by team "gogogo"
#    (submission 55891768, then rated 2,556; banked 98,623 vs 82,238), pulled
#    from https://www.kaggleusercontent.com/episodes/103384363.json. The same
#    schedule - byte-identical through step 143, >=90% agreement to step 400,
#    the remainder differing only in sell ordering - was found in 10 harvested
#    seats across five teams: A Poor Vul (#2 on the leaderboard at 2,902.6),
#    gogogo (#12), cmasch (#39), islet, Lucien de Rubempre. It is not, as far
#    as we can find, a published notebook; it is scraped from public episodes
#    exactly the way the yhay81 router below was built, and is used the same way.
#
# 2. The ten YARN_STORE-handling tapes, the FIRST_ROUTES/SECOND_ROUTES tables
#    and the replay rim are from yhay81's "Public Match History Router - Rating
#    2929 - Aug 30" (Apache License 2.0; see agents/router_yhay.py for the full
#    attribution). CHANGES MADE BY WASHAMBA BOTS to that work: the ten tapes are
#    embedded unchanged; the rim is reimplemented (step from day*24+hour, same
#    hands pad/trim) and now selects between the fam schedule and those tapes.
#
# WHY THIS SHAPE. Measured 2026-08-31 on fresh seeds 200-215, both seats, the
# fam schedule replayed alone against agents/router_yhay.py loses every seed in
# which YARN_STORE is one of the first two shops (6/6, -7k to -21k) and wins
# every seed in which it is not (10/10, mean +10.5k). The two lineages build the
# same farm in the opening (3 COW, 2 SHEEP, 12 MELON, 10 WHEAT, 12-13 hires by
# step 72), so the season can be handed over at the branch points the router
# already uses: at step 72 if YARN_STORE unlocked first (-> yhay tape 1), at
# step 144 if it is the second shop (-> yhay SECOND_ROUTES tape for the pair).
#
# MEASURED 2026-08-31, seeds 200-231 (never used to select anything), both seats,
# contested market, win count first:
#
#     vs agents/router_yhay.py (our live base, 2,471 on 79 ladder episodes)
#         this file                         47-17 of 64   mean +9,533   median +7,738
#         fam schedule alone                41-23 of 64   mean +3,956   worst -20,708
#         yhay opening, fam after step 72   34-18 of 64   mean +4,496
#         handing over on BAKERY too        43-21 of 64   mean +8,834   (worse: dropped)
#
#     Residual: the seven YARN_STORE-first seeds lose 0.3k-3.5k (yhay tape 1 on
#     the fam opening's state), against +7k to +32k on the 25 others.
#
# See docs/ROUTE_GENERATIONS.md, route generation five.

